    "body": "@LeaVerou , while I have not seen such implementation published yet, there are multiple JS libs with similar functionality, dojo's ContentPane for example. I have made such few times. The latest is  WebComponent implementation: `<embed-page src=\"url\" />`. On earlier stages it did not have CSS and JS scope insulation as you wanted. Now scope is enforced and in the future different scope insulation levels are planned, including 'none' - matching embedding content into page without insulation as you wanted. ",
